  "claim": "A separately provisioned PWCE action journal preserves original admission intent, invocation claims and outcomes across ordinary application database restoration. Current safety identity checks fence missing/replaced journal files; FULL SQLite write durability and unique claims precede action I/O. Five actual synthetic application restores recover existing producer results without repeating action sends.",
